Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS['zh-Hans'], {"Preview party": "预览队伍", "How many actors the canvas shows in party lists. Editor only: the game shows the real party.": "画布在队伍列表中显示的角色人数。仅限编辑器，游戏中显示实际队伍。"});
