// User Interfaces: battle window commands.
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ja"], {"Skill types (all the actor has)": "スキルタイプ（アクターが持つすべて）", "One skill type": "スキルタイプ（1つ）", "Use a skill": "スキルを使う", "Stock commands": "標準のコマンド", "Choose Commands": "コマンドを選ぶ", "Only actors with this skill type": "このスキルタイプを持つアクターのみ", "Only actors who know it": "習得しているアクターのみ", "One command per skill type the actor has, named as in Types.": "アクターが持つスキルタイプごとに1つのコマンド。名前は［タイプ］のものです。", "Grayed out in battles that cannot be escaped.": "逃走できない戦闘では灰色で表示されます。", "+ Add Command": "+ コマンドを追加", "Use Stock Commands": "標準のコマンドに戻す", "A blank label uses the name from Terms, Types or the skill.": "ラベルが空欄なら［用語］［タイプ］またはスキルの名前を使います。", "Its place on this canvas is only for editing. In battle it follows the target at the image's size; move it with the Enemy and Ally offsets.": "キャンバス上の位置は編集用です。戦闘では画像の大きさのまま対象に付いていきます。位置は敵と味方のオフセットで調整します。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hant"], {"Skill types (all the actor has)": "技能類型（角色擁有的全部）", "One skill type": "單一技能類型", "Use a skill": "使用技能", "Stock commands": "預設指令", "Choose Commands": "選擇指令", "Only actors with this skill type": "僅限擁有此技能類型的角色", "Only actors who know it": "僅限已習得的角色", "One command per skill type the actor has, named as in Types.": "角色擁有的每個技能類型各一個指令，名稱取自「類型」。", "Grayed out in battles that cannot be escaped.": "無法逃跑的戰鬥中會顯示為灰色。", "+ Add Command": "+ 新增指令", "Use Stock Commands": "使用預設指令", "A blank label uses the name from Terms, Types or the skill.": "標籤留空時，使用「用語」、「類型」或技能的名稱。", "Its place on this canvas is only for editing. In battle it follows the target at the image's size; move it with the Enemy and Ally offsets.": "它在畫布上的位置僅供編輯。戰鬥中它會以圖片原尺寸跟隨目標；請用敵人與同伴的偏移來調整位置。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hans"], {"Skill types (all the actor has)": "技能类型（角色拥有的全部）", "One skill type": "单个技能类型", "Use a skill": "使用技能", "Stock commands": "默认指令", "Choose Commands": "选择指令", "Only actors with this skill type": "仅限拥有此技能类型的角色", "Only actors who know it": "仅限已习得的角色", "One command per skill type the actor has, named as in Types.": "角色拥有的每个技能类型各一个指令，名称取自“类型”。", "Grayed out in battles that cannot be escaped.": "无法逃跑的战斗中会显示为灰色。", "+ Add Command": "+ 添加指令", "Use Stock Commands": "使用默认指令", "A blank label uses the name from Terms, Types or the skill.": "标签留空时，使用“用语”、“类型”或技能的名称。", "Its place on this canvas is only for editing. In battle it follows the target at the image's size; move it with the Enemy and Ally offsets.": "它在画布上的位置仅用于编辑。战斗中它会以图片原尺寸跟随目标；请用敌人和队友的偏移来调整位置。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ko"], {"Skill types (all the actor has)": "스킬 타입 (액터가 가진 전부)", "One skill type": "스킬 타입 하나", "Use a skill": "스킬 사용", "Stock commands": "기본 커맨드", "Choose Commands": "커맨드 선택", "Only actors with this skill type": "이 스킬 타입을 가진 액터만", "Only actors who know it": "습득한 액터만", "One command per skill type the actor has, named as in Types.": "액터가 가진 스킬 타입마다 커맨드 하나. 이름은 타입에서 가져옵니다.", "Grayed out in battles that cannot be escaped.": "도망칠 수 없는 전투에서는 회색으로 표시됩니다.", "+ Add Command": "+ 커맨드 추가", "Use Stock Commands": "기본 커맨드 사용", "A blank label uses the name from Terms, Types or the skill.": "라벨을 비우면 용어, 타입 또는 스킬의 이름을 사용합니다.", "Its place on this canvas is only for editing. In battle it follows the target at the image's size; move it with the Enemy and Ally offsets.": "캔버스 위치는 편집용입니다. 전투에서는 이미지 크기 그대로 대상을 따라갑니다. 위치는 적과 아군 오프셋으로 조정하세요."});
