Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ja"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "戦闘を止めてすぐに実行し、終わると同じウィンドウで選び直します。アクターの行動として使うには、コモンイベント効果を持つスキルを使ってください。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hant"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "戰鬥暫停時立即執行，結束後由同一個視窗重新選擇。若要作為角色的行動，請使用帶有公共事件效果的技能。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hans"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "战斗暂停时立即执行，结束后由同一个窗口重新选择。若要作为角色的行动，请使用带有公共事件效果的技能。"});
