Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["es"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "Se ejecuta al momento mientras el combate espera y luego la misma ventana vuelve a elegir. Para un comando que gaste el turno del actor, usa una habilidad con el efecto Evento común."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pt"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "Executa na hora enquanto a batalha espera, e a mesma janela escolhe de novo. Para um comando que gaste o turno do ator, use uma habilidade com o efeito Evento comum."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["fr"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "S’exécute aussitôt pendant que le combat attend, puis la même fenêtre choisit à nouveau. Pour une commande qui prend le tour de l’acteur, utilisez une compétence avec l’effet Événement commun."});
