Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["de"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "Läuft sofort, während der Kampf wartet; danach wählt dasselbe Fenster erneut. Für einen Befehl, der den Zug des Akteurs kostet, nimm eine Fertigkeit mit dem Effekt Gemeinsames Ereignis."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ru"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "Выполняется сразу, пока бой ждёт, затем то же окно выбирает снова. Чтобы команда тратила ход героя, используйте навык с эффектом «Общее событие»."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pl"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "Uruchamia się od razu, gdy bitwa czeka, potem to samo okno wybiera ponownie. Aby komenda zużywała turę postaci, użyj umiejętności z efektem Wspólne zdarzenie."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["el"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "Εκτελείται αμέσως ενώ η μάχη περιμένει και μετά το ίδιο παράθυρο επιλέγει ξανά. Για εντολή που ξοδεύει τη σειρά του ήρωα, χρησιμοποιήστε ικανότητα με εφέ Κοινό γεγονός."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ar"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "يعمل فورًا والمعركة متوقفة، ثم تختار النافذة نفسها من جديد. لأمر يستهلك دور الشخصية، استخدم مهارة ذات تأثير حدث عام."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["tr"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "Savaş beklerken hemen çalışır, sonra aynı pencere yeniden seçer. Karakterin sırasını harcayan bir komut için Ortak Olay etkili bir yetenek kullanın."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["id"], {"Runs at once while the battle waits, then the same window chooses again. For a command that takes the actor's turn, use a skill with a Common Event effect.": "Langsung berjalan saat pertempuran menunggu, lalu jendela yang sama memilih lagi. Untuk perintah yang memakai giliran aktor, gunakan skill dengan efek Common Event."});
