// User Interfaces: Target Cursor placement hints.
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ja"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "このキャンバス上の位置だけです。戦闘では対象の頭上を指します。そこからの調整は［ターゲットカーソル］の敵と味方のオフセットで行います。", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "対象の上端中央からのずれです。Yを正にすると下へ動きます。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hant"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "僅是它在此畫布上的位置。戰鬥中它指向目標頂端；請用「目標游標」下的敵人與同伴偏移從那裡調整。", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "相對於目標頂端中央的偏移。Y 為正值時向下移動。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hans"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "仅是它在此画布上的位置。战斗中它指向目标顶端；请用“目标光标”下的敌人和队友偏移从那里调整。", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "相对于目标顶端中央的偏移。Y 为正值时向下移动。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ko"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "이 캔버스 위의 위치일 뿐입니다. 전투에서는 대상의 머리 위를 가리키며, 거기서부터는 대상 커서의 적과 아군 오프셋으로 옮깁니다.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "대상 위쪽 가운데로부터의 오프셋입니다. Y가 양수면 아래로 움직입니다."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["es"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "Solo es su sitio en este lienzo. En combate apunta a la parte superior del objetivo; desde ahí se mueve con los desplazamientos de enemigo y aliado de Cursor de objetivo.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Desplazamientos desde el centro superior del objetivo. Una Y positiva lo baja."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pt"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "É só o lugar dele nesta tela. Na batalha ele aponta para o topo do alvo; a partir daí, mova-o com os deslocamentos de inimigo e aliado em Cursor de alvo.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Deslocamentos a partir do centro do topo do alvo. Um Y positivo o move para baixo."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["fr"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "Seulement sa place sur ce canevas. En combat, il pointe le haut de la cible ; déplacez-le de là avec les décalages ennemi et allié du Curseur de cible.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Décalages depuis le haut centre de la cible. Un Y positif le descend."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["it"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "È solo la sua posizione su questa tela. In battaglia punta alla sommità del bersaglio; da lì si sposta con gli scostamenti nemico e alleato in Cursore del bersaglio.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Scostamenti dal centro superiore del bersaglio. Una Y positiva lo sposta in basso."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["de"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "Nur seine Lage auf dieser Fläche. Im Kampf zeigt er auf die Oberkante des Ziels; von dort verschiebst du ihn mit den Versätzen für Gegner und Verbündete unter Zielcursor.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Versatz von der oberen Mitte des Ziels. Ein positives Y verschiebt ihn nach unten."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ru"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "Это только его место на холсте. В бою он указывает на верх цели; сдвигайте его оттуда смещениями для врага и союзника в разделе «Курсор цели».", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Смещения от верхней середины цели. Положительный Y сдвигает вниз."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pl"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "To tylko jego miejsce na tym płótnie. W bitwie wskazuje górę celu; stamtąd przesuwaj go przesunięciami wroga i sojusznika w Kursorze celu.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Przesunięcia od górnego środka celu. Dodatnie Y przesuwa w dół."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["el"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "Είναι μόνο η θέση του σε αυτόν τον καμβά. Στη μάχη δείχνει την κορυφή του στόχου· από εκεί μετακινήστε τον με τις μετατοπίσεις εχθρού και συμμάχου στον Δρομέα στόχου.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Μετατοπίσεις από το πάνω κέντρο του στόχου. Θετικό Y τον κατεβάζει."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ar"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "هذا موضعه على اللوحة فقط. في المعركة يشير إلى أعلى الهدف؛ حرّكه من هناك بإزاحات العدو والحليف ضمن مؤشر الهدف.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "إزاحات من منتصف أعلى الهدف. قيمة Y الموجبة تنزله إلى الأسفل."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["tr"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "Yalnızca bu tuvaldeki yeri. Savaşta hedefin tepesini gösterir; oradan Hedef İmleci altındaki düşman ve müttefik kaydırmalarıyla taşıyın.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Hedefin üst ortasından kaydırmalar. Pozitif Y aşağı taşır."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["id"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "Hanya letaknya di kanvas ini. Dalam pertempuran ia menunjuk bagian atas target; geser dari sana dengan offset musuh dan sekutu di Kursor Target.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Offset dari tengah atas target. Y positif menggesernya ke bawah."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["vi"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "Chỉ là vị trí trên khung này. Trong trận nó chỉ vào đỉnh mục tiêu; dịch từ đó bằng độ lệch kẻ địch và đồng minh ở Con trỏ mục tiêu.", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "Độ lệch từ giữa đỉnh mục tiêu. Y dương dịch xuống dưới."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["th"], {"Only where it sits on this canvas. In battle it points at the top of the target; move it from there with the Enemy and Ally offsets under Target Cursor.": "เป็นเพียงตำแหน่งบนผืนผ้าใบนี้ ในการต่อสู้มันจะชี้ที่ส่วนบนของเป้าหมาย เลื่อนจากตรงนั้นด้วยค่าเยื้องศัตรูและพันธมิตรในเคอร์เซอร์เป้าหมาย", "Offsets from the top center of the target. A positive Y moves it down.": "ค่าเยื้องจากกึ่งกลางด้านบนของเป้าหมาย Y เป็นบวกจะเลื่อนลง"});

