Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ja"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "各フェーズは割り当てられるまで下の階層から継承し、最後は組み込みの動作になります。", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "ここで割り当てたフェーズはこのバトラーの既定です。武器・スキル・アイテムが割り当てない限り、実行は素手攻撃になります。", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "ここで割り当てたフェーズは、攻撃スキルが独自に割り当てない限り、この武器での通常攻撃に使われます。", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "ここで割り当てたフェーズは、行動と武器に割り当てがないとき、このクラスのアクターに使われます。", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "ここで割り当てたフェーズは、この行動を使うたびに武器・クラス・バトラーより優先して実行されます。", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "ここで検索を止め、行動全体にエンジンまたは有効なバトルプラグインを使います。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["es"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Cada fase hereda del nivel inferior hasta que se asigna una; el último recurso es el comportamiento integrado.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Las fases asignadas aquí son los valores predeterminados de este combatiente. Ejecutar es su ataque desarmado salvo que un arma, habilidad u objeto asigne uno.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Las fases asignadas aquí se usan en los ataques normales con esta arma, salvo que la habilidad de ataque asigne las suyas.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Las fases asignadas aquí se usan para los actores de la clase cuando la acción y el arma no las asignan.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Las fases asignadas aquí se ejecutan siempre que se usa esta acción, por delante del arma, la clase y el combatiente.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Detiene la búsqueda aquí y usa el motor o el plugin de batalla activo para toda la acción."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ru"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Каждая фаза наследуется с нижнего уровня, пока не будет назначена; последний вариант — встроенное поведение.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Назначенные здесь фазы — значения по умолчанию этого бойца. «Выполнить» — его безоружная атака, если оружие, навык или предмет не назначат свою.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Назначенные здесь фазы используются для обычных атак этим оружием, если навык атаки не назначит свои.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Назначенные здесь фазы используются для актёров класса, когда действие и оружие их не назначают.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Назначенные здесь фазы выполняются при каждом использовании этого действия, прежде оружия, класса и бойца.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Останавливает поиск здесь и использует движок или включённый боевой плагин для всего действия."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pt"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Cada fase herda do nível abaixo até que uma seja atribuída; o último recurso é o comportamento integrado.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "As fases atribuídas aqui são os padrões deste combatente. Executar é seu ataque desarmado, a menos que uma arma, habilidade ou item atribua um.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "As fases atribuídas aqui são usadas em ataques normais com esta arma, a menos que a habilidade de ataque atribua as suas.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "As fases atribuídas aqui são usadas pelos atores da classe quando a ação e a arma não as atribuem.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "As fases atribuídas aqui são executadas sempre que esta ação é usada, antes da arma, da classe e do combatente.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Interrompe a busca aqui e usa o motor ou o plugin de batalha ativo para toda a ação."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["de"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Jede Phase erbt von der nächsttieferen Ebene, bis eine zugewiesen ist; der letzte Rückfall ist das eingebaute Verhalten.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Hier zugewiesene Phasen sind die Standards dieses Kämpfers. Ausführen ist sein unbewaffneter Angriff, sofern nicht Waffe, Fähigkeit oder Gegenstand einen zuweisen.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Hier zugewiesene Phasen gelten für normale Angriffe mit dieser Waffe, sofern die Angriffsfähigkeit keine eigenen zuweist.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Hier zugewiesene Phasen gelten für die Akteure der Klasse, wenn Aktion und Waffe keine zuweisen.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Hier zugewiesene Phasen laufen bei jeder Verwendung dieser Aktion, vor Waffe, Klasse und Kämpfer.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Beendet die Suche hier und verwendet die Engine oder das aktive Kampf-Plugin für die gesamte Aktion."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["fr"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Chaque phase hérite du niveau inférieur jusqu’à ce qu’une soit assignée ; le dernier recours est le comportement intégré.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Les phases assignées ici sont les valeurs par défaut de ce combattant. Exécuter est son attaque à mains nues, sauf si une arme, une compétence ou un objet en assigne une.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Les phases assignées ici servent aux attaques normales avec cette arme, sauf si la compétence d’attaque assigne les siennes.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Les phases assignées ici servent aux acteurs de la classe quand l’action et l’arme n’en assignent pas.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Les phases assignées ici s’exécutent à chaque utilisation de cette action, avant l’arme, la classe et le combattant.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Arrête la recherche ici et utilise le moteur ou le plugin de combat actif pour toute l’action."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["el"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Κάθε φάση κληρονομεί από το επόμενο χαμηλότερο επίπεδο μέχρι να ανατεθεί μία· η τελευταία επιλογή είναι η ενσωματωμένη συμπεριφορά.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Οι φάσεις που ανατίθενται εδώ είναι οι προεπιλογές αυτού του μαχητή. Η Εκτέλεση είναι η άοπλη επίθεσή του, εκτός αν όπλο, δεξιότητα ή αντικείμενο αναθέσει άλλη.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Οι φάσεις που ανατίθενται εδώ χρησιμοποιούνται για κανονικές επιθέσεις με αυτό το όπλο, εκτός αν η δεξιότητα επίθεσης αναθέσει δικές της.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Οι φάσεις που ανατίθενται εδώ χρησιμοποιούνται για τους ηθοποιούς της κλάσης όταν η ενέργεια και το όπλο δεν αναθέτουν.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Οι φάσεις που ανατίθενται εδώ εκτελούνται κάθε φορά που χρησιμοποιείται αυτή η ενέργεια, πριν από όπλο, κλάση και μαχητή.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Σταματά την αναζήτηση εδώ και χρησιμοποιεί τη μηχανή ή το ενεργό πρόσθετο μάχης για ολόκληρη την ενέργεια."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ko"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "각 단계는 지정될 때까지 아래 단계에서 상속되며, 마지막에는 기본 동작을 사용합니다.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "여기서 지정한 단계는 이 배틀러의 기본값입니다. 실행은 무기, 스킬, 아이템이 지정하지 않는 한 맨손 공격입니다.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "여기서 지정한 단계는 공격 스킬이 직접 지정하지 않는 한 이 무기의 일반 공격에 사용됩니다.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "여기서 지정한 단계는 행동과 무기가 지정하지 않을 때 이 직업의 액터에 사용됩니다.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "여기서 지정한 단계는 이 행동을 사용할 때마다 무기, 직업, 배틀러보다 우선 실행됩니다.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "여기서 검색을 멈추고 전체 행동에 엔진 또는 활성화된 전투 플러그인을 사용합니다."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ar"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "ترث كل مرحلة من المستوى الأدنى حتى يتم تعيين واحدة؛ والملاذ الأخير هو السلوك المدمج.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "المراحل المعينة هنا هي الإعدادات الافتراضية لهذا المقاتل. التنفيذ هو هجومه الأعزل ما لم يعيّن سلاح أو مهارة أو عنصر غيره.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "تُستخدم المراحل المعينة هنا للهجمات العادية بهذا السلاح، ما لم تعيّن مهارة الهجوم مراحلها الخاصة.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "تُستخدم المراحل المعينة هنا لممثلي الفئة عندما لا يعيّنها الإجراء والسلاح.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "تُنفذ المراحل المعينة هنا كلما استُخدم هذا الإجراء، قبل السلاح والفئة والمقاتل.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "يوقف البحث هنا ويستخدم المحرك أو إضافة المعركة المفعّلة للإجراء بأكمله."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["it"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Ogni fase eredita dal livello inferiore finché non ne viene assegnata una; l’ultima risorsa è il comportamento integrato.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Le fasi assegnate qui sono i valori predefiniti di questo combattente. Esegui è il suo attacco a mani nude, a meno che un’arma, un’abilità o un oggetto ne assegni uno.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Le fasi assegnate qui si usano per gli attacchi normali con quest’arma, a meno che l’abilità di attacco assegni le proprie.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Le fasi assegnate qui si usano per gli attori della classe quando azione e arma non le assegnano.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Le fasi assegnate qui vengono eseguite ogni volta che si usa quest’azione, prima di arma, classe e combattente.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Interrompe qui la ricerca e usa il motore o il plugin di battaglia attivo per l’intera azione."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pl"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Każda faza dziedziczy z niższego poziomu, dopóki nie zostanie przypisana; ostatecznością jest wbudowane zachowanie.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Fazy przypisane tutaj są domyślne dla tego walczącego. Wykonanie to jego atak bez broni, chyba że broń, umiejętność lub przedmiot przypisze inny.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Fazy przypisane tutaj są używane przy zwykłych atakach tą bronią, chyba że umiejętność ataku przypisze własne.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Fazy przypisane tutaj są używane dla aktorów klasy, gdy akcja i broń ich nie przypisują.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Fazy przypisane tutaj uruchamiają się przy każdym użyciu tej akcji, przed bronią, klasą i walczącym.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Zatrzymuje wyszukiwanie tutaj i używa silnika lub włączonej wtyczki bitewnej dla całej akcji."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["id"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Setiap fase mewarisi dari tingkat di bawahnya sampai satu ditetapkan; cadangan terakhir adalah perilaku bawaan.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Fase yang ditetapkan di sini adalah bawaan petarung ini. Eksekusi adalah serangan tanpa senjatanya kecuali senjata, skill, atau item menetapkannya.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Fase yang ditetapkan di sini digunakan untuk serangan biasa dengan senjata ini, kecuali skill serangan menetapkan miliknya sendiri.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Fase yang ditetapkan di sini digunakan untuk aktor kelas ini saat aksi dan senjata tidak menetapkannya.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Fase yang ditetapkan di sini berjalan setiap kali aksi ini digunakan, mendahului senjata, kelas, dan petarung.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Menghentikan pencarian di sini dan menggunakan mesin atau plugin pertempuran aktif untuk seluruh aksi."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["vi"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Mỗi giai đoạn kế thừa từ cấp thấp hơn cho đến khi được gán; phương án cuối cùng là hành vi tích hợp.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Các giai đoạn gán ở đây là mặc định của chiến binh này. Thực hiện là đòn tấn công tay không trừ khi vũ khí, kỹ năng hoặc vật phẩm gán khác.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Các giai đoạn gán ở đây dùng cho đòn tấn công thường bằng vũ khí này, trừ khi kỹ năng tấn công tự gán.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Các giai đoạn gán ở đây dùng cho các diễn viên của lớp khi hành động và vũ khí không gán.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Các giai đoạn gán ở đây chạy mỗi khi dùng hành động này, ưu tiên trước vũ khí, lớp và chiến binh.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Dừng tìm kiếm tại đây và dùng engine hoặc plugin chiến đấu đang bật cho toàn bộ hành động."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["th"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "แต่ละเฟสจะสืบทอดจากระดับที่ต่ำกว่าจนกว่าจะมีการกำหนด ทางเลือกสุดท้ายคือพฤติกรรมในตัว", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "เฟสที่กำหนดที่นี่คือค่าเริ่มต้นของตัวต่อสู้นี้ การดำเนินการคือการโจมตีมือเปล่า เว้นแต่อาวุธ สกิล หรือไอเทมจะกำหนดเอง", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "เฟสที่กำหนดที่นี่ใช้กับการโจมตีปกติด้วยอาวุธนี้ เว้นแต่สกิลโจมตีจะกำหนดของตัวเอง", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "เฟสที่กำหนดที่นี่ใช้กับตัวละครของอาชีพนี้เมื่อการกระทำและอาวุธไม่ได้กำหนด", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "เฟสที่กำหนดที่นี่จะทำงานทุกครั้งที่ใช้การกระทำนี้ ก่อนอาวุธ อาชีพ และตัวต่อสู้", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "หยุดการค้นหาที่นี่และใช้เอนจินหรือปลั๊กอินการต่อสู้ที่เปิดใช้สำหรับการกระทำทั้งหมด"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["tr"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "Her aşama, biri atanana kadar bir alt seviyeden devralır; son çare yerleşik davranıştır.", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "Burada atanan aşamalar bu savaşçının varsayılanlarıdır. Yürütme, bir silah, beceri veya eşya atamadıkça silahsız saldırısıdır.", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "Burada atanan aşamalar, saldırı becerisi kendininkini atamadıkça bu silahla yapılan normal saldırılarda kullanılır.", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "Burada atanan aşamalar, eylem ve silah atamadığında sınıfın aktörleri için kullanılır.", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "Burada atanan aşamalar bu eylem her kullanıldığında silah, sınıf ve savaşçıdan önce çalışır.", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "Aramayı burada durdurur ve tüm eylem için motoru veya etkin savaş eklentisini kullanır."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hant"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "每個階段會從下一層級繼承，直到有指定為止；最後的備援是內建行為。", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "此處指定的階段是這名戰鬥者的預設。除非武器、技能或物品另有指定，否則「執行」就是其徒手攻擊。", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "此處指定的階段用於此武器的普通攻擊，除非攻擊技能另有指定。", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "當行動與武器未指定時，此處指定的階段用於此職業的角色。", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "此處指定的階段會在每次使用此行動時執行，優先於武器、職業與戰鬥者。", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "在此停止查找，整個行動改用引擎或已啟用的戰鬥插件。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hans"], {"Each phase inherits from the next level down until one is assigned; the last fallback is the built-in behavior.": "每个阶段会从下一层级继承，直到有指定为止；最后的后备是内置行为。", "Phases assigned here are this battler’s defaults. Execute is its unarmed attack unless a weapon, skill or item assigns one.": "此处指定的阶段是该战斗者的默认值。除非武器、技能或物品另有指定，否则“执行”就是其徒手攻击。", "Phases assigned here run for normal attacks with this weapon, unless the attack skill assigns its own.": "此处指定的阶段用于此武器的普通攻击，除非攻击技能另有指定。", "Phases assigned here run for the class’s actors when the action and weapon leave them unassigned.": "当行动与武器未指定时，此处指定的阶段用于该职业的角色。", "Phases assigned here run whenever this action is used, ahead of the weapon, class and battler.": "此处指定的阶段会在每次使用此行动时执行，优先于武器、职业和战斗者。", "Stops the lookup here and uses the engine or enabled battle plugin for the whole action.": "在此停止查找，整个行动改用引擎或已启用的战斗插件。"});
