Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ja"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "完全なシーケンス: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "モデルのポーズを編集…", "Engine / plugin action": "エンジン／プラグインの行動", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "モデルのポーズとクリップ: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "モデルのポーズとクリップ", "Sprite Motions": "スプライトモーション", "Other": "その他", "{n} assigned": "{n} 件割り当て済み", "Using defaults": "既定を使用", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "リアクションと待機モーション", "Turn and Scale": "回転と拡大縮小", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "{axis}軸回転（度）", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "ポーズとクリップはデータベース › 3Dモデルでパーツごとにリグし、ここでは名前で指定してこのステップのフレーム数で再生します。", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "上の行動フェーズとは別に、バトラーの立ち姿、被弾、回避、倒れ方を決めます。ダメージは適用しません。", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "スプライトモーションはバトラーシートの行を選びます。パーツをポーズさせるにはバトラーに3Dモデルを設定してください。", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "回転はこのステップのフレーム数とイージングで、直前のポーズから進みます。バク宙: 1つのステップでZを上げてXを−360回転。2Dスプライトの回転はZのみです。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["es"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Secuencia completa: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Editar poses del modelo…", "Engine / plugin action": "Acción del motor / plugin", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Poses y clips del modelo: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Poses y clips del modelo", "Sprite Motions": "Movimientos del sprite", "Other": "Otros", "{n} assigned": "{n} asignados", "Using defaults": "Usando valores predeterminados", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Reacciones y movimientos de espera", "Turn and Scale": "Giro y escala", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Giro {axis} (grados)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Las poses y los clips se riguean por parte en Base de datos › Modelos 3D y aquí se reproducen por nombre durante los fotogramas de este paso.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Aparte de las fases de acción de arriba: cómo el combatiente se mantiene, recibe golpes, esquiva o cae. Nunca aplican daño.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Los movimientos del sprite eligen una fila de la hoja del combatiente. Asigna un modelo 3D al combatiente para posar sus partes.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Los giros duran los fotogramas de este paso con su suavizado, desde la pose anterior. Voltereta: sube Z y gira X −360 en un paso; los sprites 2D solo giran en Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ru"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Полная последовательность: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Изменить позы модели…", "Engine / plugin action": "Действие движка / плагина", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Позы и клипы модели: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Позы и клипы модели", "Sprite Motions": "Движения спрайта", "Other": "Другое", "{n} assigned": "Назначено: {n}", "Using defaults": "Используются значения по умолчанию", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Реакции и движения ожидания", "Turn and Scale": "Поворот и масштаб", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Поворот {axis} (градусы)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Позы и клипы настраиваются по частям в База данных › 3D-модели и воспроизводятся здесь по имени в течение кадров этого шага.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Отдельно от фаз действия выше: как боец стоит, получает удар, уклоняется или падает. Урон они не наносят.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Движения спрайта выбирают строку листа бойца. Дайте бойцу 3D-модель, чтобы позировать его части.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Повороты идут в течение кадров этого шага с его сглаживанием от предыдущей позы. Сальто назад: поднимите Z и поверните X на −360 за один шаг; 2D-спрайты вращаются только по Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pt"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Sequência completa: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Editar poses do modelo…", "Engine / plugin action": "Ação do motor / plugin", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Poses e clipes do modelo: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Poses e clipes do modelo", "Sprite Motions": "Movimentos do sprite", "Other": "Outros", "{n} assigned": "{n} atribuídos", "Using defaults": "Usando padrões", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Reações e movimentos de espera", "Turn and Scale": "Giro e escala", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Giro {axis} (graus)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Poses e clipes são rigados por parte em Banco de dados › Modelos 3D e tocam aqui pelo nome durante os quadros deste passo.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Separado das fases de ação acima: como o combatente fica parado, apanha, esquiva ou cai. Nunca aplicam dano.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Os movimentos do sprite escolhem uma linha da folha do combatente. Dê ao combatente um modelo 3D para posar suas partes.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Os giros duram os quadros deste passo com sua suavização, a partir da pose anterior. Mortal para trás: suba Z e gire X em −360 em um passo; sprites 2D só giram em Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["de"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Vollständige Sequenz: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Modellposen bearbeiten…", "Engine / plugin action": "Engine-/Plugin-Aktion", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Modellposen und -clips: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Modellposen und -clips", "Sprite Motions": "Sprite-Bewegungen", "Other": "Sonstige", "{n} assigned": "{n} zugewiesen", "Using defaults": "Standard wird verwendet", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Reaktionen und Ruhebewegungen", "Turn and Scale": "Drehen und skalieren", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Drehung {axis} (Grad)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Posen und Clips werden in Datenbank › 3D-Modelle je Teil geriggt und laufen hier nach Namen über die Frames dieses Schritts.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Getrennt von den Aktionsphasen oben: wie der Kämpfer steht, getroffen wird, ausweicht oder fällt. Sie richten nie Schaden an.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Sprite-Bewegungen wählen eine Zeile des Kämpferblatts. Gib dem Kämpfer ein 3D-Modell, um seine Teile zu posieren.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Drehungen laufen über die Frames dieses Schritts mit seiner Glättung ab der vorigen Pose. Rückwärtssalto: Z anheben und X in einem Schritt um −360 drehen; 2D-Sprites drehen nur um Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["fr"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Séquence complète : {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Modifier les poses du modèle…", "Engine / plugin action": "Action du moteur / plugin", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Poses et clips du modèle : {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Poses et clips du modèle", "Sprite Motions": "Mouvements du sprite", "Other": "Autres", "{n} assigned": "{n} assignés", "Using defaults": "Valeurs par défaut", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Réactions et mouvements d’attente", "Turn and Scale": "Rotation et échelle", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Rotation {axis} (degrés)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Les poses et clips sont riggés par partie dans Base de données › Modèles 3D et se jouent ici par nom sur les images de cette étape.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Distinct des phases d’action ci-dessus : comment le combattant se tient, encaisse, esquive ou tombe. Aucun dégât n’est appliqué.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Les mouvements du sprite choisissent une ligne de la planche du combattant. Donnez un modèle 3D au combattant pour poser ses parties.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Les rotations durent les images de cette étape avec son lissage, depuis la pose précédente. Salto arrière : montez Z et tournez X de −360 en une étape ; les sprites 2D ne tournent que sur Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["el"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Πλήρης ακολουθία: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Επεξεργασία πόζων μοντέλου…", "Engine / plugin action": "Ενέργεια μηχανής / πρόσθετου", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Πόζες και κλιπ μοντέλου: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Πόζες και κλιπ μοντέλου", "Sprite Motions": "Κινήσεις sprite", "Other": "Άλλα", "{n} assigned": "{n} ανατεθειμένα", "Using defaults": "Χρήση προεπιλογών", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Αντιδράσεις και κινήσεις αναμονής", "Turn and Scale": "Περιστροφή και κλίμακα", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Περιστροφή {axis} (μοίρες)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Οι πόζες και τα κλιπ ρυθμίζονται ανά μέρος στη Βάση δεδομένων › Μοντέλα 3D και παίζουν εδώ με το όνομά τους στα καρέ αυτού του βήματος.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Ξεχωριστά από τις φάσεις ενέργειας παραπάνω: πώς στέκεται, χτυπιέται, αποφεύγει ή πέφτει ο μαχητής. Δεν προκαλούν ποτέ ζημιά.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Οι κινήσεις sprite επιλέγουν μια σειρά του φύλλου μαχητή. Δώστε στον μαχητή ένα μοντέλο 3D για να ποζάρετε τα μέρη του.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Οι περιστροφές τρέχουν στα καρέ αυτού του βήματος με την εξομάλυνσή του, από την προηγούμενη πόζα. Ανάποδη τούμπα: ανεβάστε το Z και γυρίστε το X κατά −360 σε ένα βήμα· τα 2D sprite γυρίζουν μόνο στο Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ko"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "완전한 시퀀스: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "모델 포즈 편집…", "Engine / plugin action": "엔진 / 플러그인 행동", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "모델 포즈와 클립: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "모델 포즈와 클립", "Sprite Motions": "스프라이트 모션", "Other": "기타", "{n} assigned": "{n}개 지정됨", "Using defaults": "기본값 사용", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "리액션과 대기 모션", "Turn and Scale": "회전과 크기", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "{axis} 회전(도)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "포즈와 클립은 데이터베이스 › 3D 모델에서 부위별로 리깅하고, 여기서는 이름으로 이 단계의 프레임 동안 재생합니다.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "위의 행동 단계와 별개로, 배틀러가 서 있고, 맞고, 회피하고, 쓰러지는 방식입니다. 대미지는 적용하지 않습니다.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "스프라이트 모션은 배틀러 시트의 행을 고릅니다. 부위를 포즈하려면 배틀러에 3D 모델을 지정하세요.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "회전은 이 단계의 프레임 동안 이징을 적용해 이전 포즈에서 진행됩니다. 백플립: 한 단계에서 Z를 올리고 X를 −360 회전합니다. 2D 스프라이트는 Z로만 회전합니다."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ar"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "تسلسل كامل: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "تحرير أوضاع النموذج…", "Engine / plugin action": "إجراء المحرك / الإضافة", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "أوضاع النموذج ومقاطعه: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "أوضاع النموذج ومقاطعه", "Sprite Motions": "حركات الرسم المتحرك", "Other": "أخرى", "{n} assigned": "{n} معيّن", "Using defaults": "استخدام الإعدادات الافتراضية", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "ردود الفعل وحركات الانتظار", "Turn and Scale": "الدوران والتحجيم", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "دوران {axis} (بالدرجات)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "تُهيّأ الأوضاع والمقاطع لكل جزء في قاعدة البيانات › النماذج ثلاثية الأبعاد وتُشغَّل هنا بالاسم خلال إطارات هذه الخطوة.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "بمعزل عن مراحل الإجراء أعلاه: كيف يقف المقاتل ويتلقى الضربات ويتفادى ويسقط. لا تُلحق ضررًا أبدًا.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "تختار حركات الرسم المتحرك صفًا من لوحة المقاتل. أعطِ المقاتل نموذجًا ثلاثي الأبعاد لتحريك أجزائه.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "تجري الدورانات خلال إطارات هذه الخطوة بتنعيمها انطلاقًا من الوضع السابق. شقلبة خلفية: ارفع Z ودوّر X بمقدار −360 في خطوة واحدة؛ الرسوم ثنائية الأبعاد تدور على Z فقط."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["it"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Sequenza completa: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Modifica pose del modello…", "Engine / plugin action": "Azione del motore / plugin", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Pose e clip del modello: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Pose e clip del modello", "Sprite Motions": "Movimenti dello sprite", "Other": "Altro", "{n} assigned": "{n} assegnati", "Using defaults": "Impostazioni predefinite", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Reazioni e movimenti di attesa", "Turn and Scale": "Rotazione e scala", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Rotazione {axis} (gradi)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Le pose e le clip si riggano per parte in Database › Modelli 3D e qui vengono riprodotte per nome nei fotogrammi di questo passo.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Separato dalle fasi di azione sopra: come il combattente sta fermo, viene colpito, schiva o cade. Non applicano mai danni.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "I movimenti dello sprite scelgono una riga del foglio del combattente. Assegna al combattente un modello 3D per posare le sue parti.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Le rotazioni durano i fotogrammi di questo passo con il suo easing, dalla posa precedente. Salto mortale all’indietro: alza Z e ruota X di −360 in un passo; gli sprite 2D ruotano solo su Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pl"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Pełna sekwencja: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Edytuj pozy modelu…", "Engine / plugin action": "Akcja silnika / wtyczki", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Pozy i klipy modelu: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Pozy i klipy modelu", "Sprite Motions": "Ruchy sprite’a", "Other": "Inne", "{n} assigned": "Przypisano: {n}", "Using defaults": "Używane domyślne", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Reakcje i ruchy oczekiwania", "Turn and Scale": "Obrót i skala", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Obrót {axis} (stopnie)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Pozy i klipy rigguje się dla każdej części w Baza danych › Modele 3D i odtwarza tutaj po nazwie przez klatki tego kroku.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Niezależnie od faz akcji powyżej: jak walczący stoi, obrywa, unika lub upada. Nigdy nie zadają obrażeń.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Ruchy sprite’a wybierają wiersz arkusza walczącego. Nadaj walczącemu model 3D, aby pozować jego części.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Obroty trwają przez klatki tego kroku z jego wygładzaniem, od poprzedniej pozy. Salto w tył: podnieś Z i obróć X o −360 w jednym kroku; sprite’y 2D obracają się tylko wokół Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["id"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Urutan lengkap: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Edit Pose Model…", "Engine / plugin action": "Aksi mesin / plugin", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Pose dan Klip Model: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Pose dan Klip Model", "Sprite Motions": "Gerakan Sprite", "Other": "Lainnya", "{n} assigned": "{n} ditetapkan", "Using defaults": "Memakai bawaan", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Reaksi dan Gerakan Diam", "Turn and Scale": "Putar dan Skala", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Putar {axis} (derajat)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Pose dan klip dirig per bagian di Basis Data › Model 3D dan diputar di sini berdasarkan nama selama frame langkah ini.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Terpisah dari fase aksi di atas: cara petarung berdiri, terkena, menghindar, atau jatuh. Tidak pernah memberi kerusakan.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Gerakan sprite memilih baris lembar petarung. Beri petarung model 3D untuk memposekan bagiannya.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Putaran berjalan selama frame langkah ini dengan easing-nya, dari pose sebelumnya. Salto belakang: naikkan Z dan putar X −360 dalam satu langkah; sprite 2D hanya berputar pada Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["vi"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Chuỗi hoàn chỉnh: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Sửa tư thế mô hình…", "Engine / plugin action": "Hành động của engine / plugin", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Tư thế và clip mô hình: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Tư thế và clip mô hình", "Sprite Motions": "Chuyển động sprite", "Other": "Khác", "{n} assigned": "Đã gán {n}", "Using defaults": "Dùng mặc định", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Phản ứng và chuyển động chờ", "Turn and Scale": "Xoay và tỉ lệ", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Xoay {axis} (độ)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Tư thế và clip được rig theo từng bộ phận trong Cơ sở dữ liệu › Mô hình 3D và phát ở đây theo tên trong số khung hình của bước này.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Tách biệt với các giai đoạn hành động ở trên: cách chiến binh đứng, bị đánh, né hoặc ngã. Không bao giờ gây sát thương.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Chuyển động sprite chọn một hàng của bảng chiến binh. Gán mô hình 3D cho chiến binh để tạo tư thế các bộ phận.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Xoay diễn ra trong số khung hình của bước này với easing của nó, từ tư thế trước. Lộn ngược: nâng Z và xoay X −360 trong một bước; sprite 2D chỉ xoay theo Z."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["th"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "ลำดับสมบูรณ์: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "แก้ไขท่าทางโมเดล…", "Engine / plugin action": "การกระทำของเอนจิน / ปลั๊กอิน", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "ท่าทางและคลิปของโมเดล: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "ท่าทางและคลิปของโมเดล", "Sprite Motions": "ท่าทางสไปรต์", "Other": "อื่นๆ", "{n} assigned": "กำหนดแล้ว {n}", "Using defaults": "ใช้ค่าเริ่มต้น", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "ปฏิกิริยาและท่ายืนรอ", "Turn and Scale": "หมุนและปรับขนาด", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "หมุน {axis} (องศา)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "ท่าทางและคลิปถูกริกทีละส่วนใน ฐานข้อมูล › โมเดล 3D และเล่นที่นี่ตามชื่อตลอดเฟรมของขั้นตอนนี้", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "แยกจากเฟสการกระทำด้านบน: ตัวต่อสู้ยืน โดนโจมตี หลบ หรือล้มอย่างไร ไม่สร้างความเสียหาย", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "ท่าทางสไปรต์เลือกแถวของชีตตัวต่อสู้ ให้ตัวต่อสู้มีโมเดล 3D เพื่อจัดท่าส่วนต่างๆ", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "การหมุนดำเนินตลอดเฟรมของขั้นตอนนี้ด้วยการผ่อนของมัน จากท่าก่อนหน้า ตีลังกาหลัง: ยก Z และหมุน X −360 ในขั้นตอนเดียว สไปรต์ 2D หมุนได้เฉพาะแกน Z"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["tr"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "Tam dizi: {name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "Model Pozlarını Düzenle…", "Engine / plugin action": "Motor / eklenti eylemi", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "Model Pozları ve Klipleri: {name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "Model Pozları ve Klipleri", "Sprite Motions": "Sprite Hareketleri", "Other": "Diğer", "{n} assigned": "{n} atandı", "Using defaults": "Varsayılanlar kullanılıyor", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "Tepkiler ve Bekleme Hareketleri", "Turn and Scale": "Döndür ve Ölçekle", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "Döndür {axis} (derece)", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "Pozlar ve klipler Veritabanı › 3B Modeller içinde parça parça riglenir ve burada bu adımın kareleri boyunca adla oynatılır.", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "Yukarıdaki eylem aşamalarından ayrı: savaşçının nasıl durduğu, vurulduğu, kaçındığı veya düştüğü. Asla hasar uygulamazlar.", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "Sprite hareketleri savaşçı sayfasından bir satır seçer. Parçalarını pozlamak için savaşçıya bir 3B model verin.", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "Dönüşler bu adımın kareleri boyunca, yumuşatmasıyla, önceki pozdan başlar. Geri takla: tek adımda Z’yi yükseltin ve X’i −360 döndürün; 2B sprite’lar yalnızca Z’de döner."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hant"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "完整序列：{name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "編輯模型姿勢…", "Engine / plugin action": "引擎／插件行動", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "模型姿勢與片段：{name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "模型姿勢與片段", "Sprite Motions": "精靈動作", "Other": "其他", "{n} assigned": "已指定 {n} 項", "Using defaults": "使用預設", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "反應與待機動作", "Turn and Scale": "旋轉與縮放", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "{axis} 軸旋轉（度）", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "姿勢與片段在資料庫 › 3D 模型中按部件綁定，並在此依名稱於本步驟的影格內播放。", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "與上方的行動階段分開：戰鬥者如何站立、受擊、閃避或倒下。這些不會造成傷害。", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "精靈動作選取戰鬥者圖表的一列。為戰鬥者指定 3D 模型即可擺放各部件姿勢。", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "旋轉在本步驟的影格內以其緩動從前一姿勢開始。後空翻：在一個步驟中抬高 Z 並將 X 旋轉 −360；2D 精靈只能繞 Z 旋轉。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hans"], {"Complete sequence: {name}": "完整序列：{name}", "Edit Model Poses…": "编辑模型姿势…", "Engine / plugin action": "引擎／插件行动", "Model Poses and Clips: {name}": "模型姿势与片段：{name}", "Model Poses and Clips": "模型姿势与片段", "Sprite Motions": "精灵动作", "Other": "其他", "{n} assigned": "已指定 {n} 项", "Using defaults": "使用默认", "Reactions and Idle Motions": "反应与待机动作", "Turn and Scale": "旋转与缩放", "Turn {axis} (degrees)": "{axis} 轴旋转（度）", "Poses and clips are rigged per part in Database › 3D Models and play here by name over this step’s frames.": "姿势与片段在数据库 › 3D 模型中按部件绑定，并在此按名称于本步骤的帧内播放。", "Separate from the action phases above: how the battler stands, gets hit, evades, or falls. These never apply damage.": "与上方的行动阶段分开：战斗者如何站立、受击、闪避或倒下。这些不会造成伤害。", "Sprite motions pick a row of the battler sheet. Give the battler a 3D model to pose its parts.": "精灵动作选取战斗者图表的一行。为战斗者指定 3D 模型即可摆放各部件姿势。", "Turns run over this step’s frames with its easing, from the previous pose. Backflip: raise Z and turn X by −360 in one step; 2D sprites only turn on Z.": "旋转在本步骤的帧内以其缓动从前一姿势开始。后空翻：在一个步骤中抬高 Z 并将 X 旋转 −360；2D 精灵只能绕 Z 旋转。"});

