Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["fr"], {"Sound Effect":"Effet sonore","System Sound":"Son système","Stop Sound Effects":"Arrêter les effets sonores","Battler":"Combattant","Camera & Screen":"Caméra et écran","Battle UI":"Interface de combat","Targets":"Cibles","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Court vers la cible et s'arrête juste avant.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Un coup au corps à corps : approche, frappe, retour.","Walk back to the home position.":"Revient à pied à la position de départ.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Déplace un combattant vers la cible, sa position ou un décalage.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Change la destination de Retour à la base.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Tourne un combattant vers une direction ou un combattant.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Saute en arc et retombe sur place.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"S'élève et reste en l'air jusqu'à une Chute.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Monte d'une hauteur et y reste.","Drop to a landing height.":"Descend jusqu'à une hauteur d'atterrissage.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Joue un mouvement ou un clip du modèle.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Fige une image d'un mouvement de sprite.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Fait apparaître ou disparaître un combattant en fondu.","Flash the battler white.":"Fait flasher le combattant en blanc.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Applique les dégâts et effets de la compétence ou de l'objet.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Affiche une animation de la base de données sur un combattant.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Affiche, déplace ou masque l'arme tenue.","Throw something at the target.":"Lance quelque chose sur la cible.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Met la séquence en pause pendant un nombre d'images.","Play another sequence here.":"Joue une autre séquence ici.","Play a sound effect file.":"Joue un fichier d'effet sonore.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"Joue un des sons système, comme Curseur ou OK.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Arrête tous les effets sonores en cours.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Déplace, zoome ou tourne la caméra de combat.","Flash the whole screen.":"Fait flasher tout l'écran.","Tint the screen.":"Teinte l'écran.","Shake the screen.":"Secoue l'écran."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["de"], {"Sound Effect":"Soundeffekt","System Sound":"Systemton","Stop Sound Effects":"Soundeffekte stoppen","Battler":"Kämpfer","Camera & Screen":"Kamera und Bildschirm","Battle UI":"Kampf-UI","Targets":"Ziele","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Läuft zum Ziel und hält kurz davor an.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Ein Nahkampftreffer: annähern, schlagen, zurück.","Walk back to the home position.":"Geht zur Ausgangsposition zurück.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Bewegt einen Kämpfer zum Ziel, nach Hause oder um einen Versatz.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Ändert, wohin Zurück nach Hause führt.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Dreht einen Kämpfer zu einer Richtung oder einem Kämpfer.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Springt im Bogen und landet an derselben Stelle.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"Steigt auf und bleibt bis zu einem Fall in der Luft.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Schwebt um eine Höhe nach oben und bleibt dort.","Drop to a landing height.":"Sinkt auf eine Landehöhe.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Spielt eine Bewegung oder einen Modell-Clip.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Friert ein Bild einer Sprite-Bewegung ein.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Blendet einen Kämpfer ein oder aus.","Flash the battler white.":"Lässt den Kämpfer weiß aufblitzen.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Wendet Schaden und Effekte der Fähigkeit oder des Gegenstands an.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Zeigt eine Datenbank-Animation auf einem Kämpfer.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Zeigt, bewegt oder verbirgt die gehaltene Waffe.","Throw something at the target.":"Wirft etwas auf das Ziel.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Hält die Sequenz eine Anzahl Frames an.","Play another sequence here.":"Spielt hier eine andere Sequenz.","Play a sound effect file.":"Spielt eine Soundeffekt-Datei.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"Spielt einen der Systemtöne, etwa Cursor oder OK.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Stoppt alle laufenden Soundeffekte.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Bewegt, zoomt oder dreht die Kampfkamera.","Flash the whole screen.":"Lässt den ganzen Bildschirm aufblitzen.","Tint the screen.":"Tönt den Bildschirm.","Shake the screen.":"Erschüttert den Bildschirm."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["it"], {"Sound Effect":"Effetto sonoro","System Sound":"Suono di sistema","Stop Sound Effects":"Ferma effetti sonori","Battler":"Combattente","Camera & Screen":"Camera e schermo","Battle UI":"Interfaccia di battaglia","Targets":"Bersagli","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Corre verso il bersaglio e si ferma poco prima.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Un colpo ravvicinato: avvicinarsi, colpire, tornare.","Walk back to the home position.":"Torna a piedi alla posizione iniziale.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Sposta un combattente verso il bersaglio, la base o uno scostamento.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Cambia dove porta Torna alla base.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Gira un combattente verso una direzione o un combattente.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Salta ad arco e atterra sul posto.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"Si alza e resta in aria fino a una Caduta.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Sale di un'altezza e resta lì.","Drop to a landing height.":"Scende fino a un'altezza di atterraggio.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Riproduce un movimento o una clip del modello.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Blocca un fotogramma di un movimento sprite.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Fa apparire o sparire un combattente in dissolvenza.","Flash the battler white.":"Illumina il combattente di bianco.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Applica danni ed effetti dell'abilità o dell'oggetto.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Mostra un'animazione del database su un combattente.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Mostra, sposta o nasconde l'arma impugnata.","Throw something at the target.":"Lancia qualcosa al bersaglio.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Mette in pausa la sequenza per un numero di fotogrammi.","Play another sequence here.":"Riproduce qui un'altra sequenza.","Play a sound effect file.":"Riproduce un file di effetto sonoro.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"Riproduce uno dei suoni di sistema, come Cursore o OK.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Ferma tutti gli effetti sonori in corso.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Sposta, ingrandisce o ruota la camera di battaglia.","Flash the whole screen.":"Illumina tutto lo schermo.","Tint the screen.":"Colora lo schermo.","Shake the screen.":"Scuote lo schermo."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ru"], {"Sound Effect":"Звуковой эффект","System Sound":"Системный звук","Stop Sound Effects":"Остановить звуковые эффекты","Battler":"Боец","Camera & Screen":"Камера и экран","Battle UI":"Интерфейс боя","Targets":"Цели","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Подбегает к цели и останавливается перед ней.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Ближний удар: подойти, ударить, вернуться.","Walk back to the home position.":"Возвращается пешком на исходную позицию.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Перемещает бойца к цели, домой или на смещение.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Меняет, куда ведёт Возврат домой.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Поворачивает бойца в сторону направления или бойца.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Прыгает по дуге и приземляется на месте.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"Взлетает и остаётся в воздухе до Падения.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Поднимается на высоту и остаётся там.","Drop to a landing height.":"Опускается до высоты приземления.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Проигрывает движение или клип модели.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Замораживает один кадр движения спрайта.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Плавно проявляет или скрывает бойца.","Flash the battler white.":"Вспышка бойца белым.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Наносит урон и эффекты навыка или предмета.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Показывает анимацию из базы данных на бойце.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Показывает, двигает или скрывает оружие в руке.","Throw something at the target.":"Бросает что-то в цель.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Приостанавливает последовательность на число кадров.","Play another sequence here.":"Проигрывает здесь другую последовательность.","Play a sound effect file.":"Проигрывает файл звукового эффекта.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"Проигрывает один из системных звуков, например Курсор или ОК.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Останавливает все звучащие эффекты.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Двигает, приближает или поворачивает боевую камеру.","Flash the whole screen.":"Вспышка всего экрана.","Tint the screen.":"Тонирует экран.","Shake the screen.":"Трясёт экран."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["pl"], {"Sound Effect":"Efekt dźwiękowy","System Sound":"Dźwięk systemowy","Stop Sound Effects":"Zatrzymaj efekty dźwiękowe","Battler":"Walczący","Camera & Screen":"Kamera i ekran","Battle UI":"Interfejs walki","Targets":"Cele","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Biegnie do celu i zatrzymuje się tuż przed nim.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Cios z bliska: podejście, uderzenie, powrót.","Walk back to the home position.":"Wraca pieszo na pozycję wyjściową.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Przenosi walczącego do celu, na pozycję wyjściową lub o przesunięcie.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Zmienia, gdzie prowadzi Powrót do bazy.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Obraca walczącego w stronę kierunku lub walczącego.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Skacze łukiem i ląduje w miejscu.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"Unosi się i pozostaje w powietrzu do Upadku.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Unosi się o wysokość i tam zostaje.","Drop to a landing height.":"Opada do wysokości lądowania.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Odtwarza ruch lub klip modelu.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Zamraża jedną klatkę ruchu sprite'a.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Wygasza lub wyświetla walczącego płynnie.","Flash the battler white.":"Rozbłysk walczącego na biało.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Zadaje obrażenia i efekty umiejętności lub przedmiotu.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Pokazuje animację z bazy danych na walczącym.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Pokazuje, przesuwa lub ukrywa trzymaną broń.","Throw something at the target.":"Rzuca czymś w cel.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Wstrzymuje sekwencję na liczbę klatek.","Play another sequence here.":"Odtwarza tu inną sekwencję.","Play a sound effect file.":"Odtwarza plik efektu dźwiękowego.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"Odtwarza jeden z dźwięków systemowych, np. Kursor lub OK.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Zatrzymuje wszystkie grające efekty dźwiękowe.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Przesuwa, przybliża lub obraca kamerę walki.","Flash the whole screen.":"Rozbłysk całego ekranu.","Tint the screen.":"Barwi ekran.","Shake the screen.":"Trzęsie ekranem."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["el"], {"Sound Effect":"Ηχητικό εφέ","System Sound":"Ήχος συστήματος","Stop Sound Effects":"Διακοπή ηχητικών εφέ","Battler":"Μαχητής","Camera & Screen":"Κάμερα και οθόνη","Battle UI":"Διεπαφή μάχης","Targets":"Στόχοι","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Τρέχει προς τον στόχο και σταματά λίγο πριν.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Χτύπημα από κοντά: προσέγγιση, χτύπημα, επιστροφή.","Walk back to the home position.":"Επιστρέφει περπατώντας στην αρχική θέση.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Μετακινεί έναν μαχητή στον στόχο, στη βάση ή σε μια μετατόπιση.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Αλλάζει πού οδηγεί η Επιστροφή στη βάση.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Στρέφει έναν μαχητή προς μια κατεύθυνση ή έναν μαχητή.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Πηδά σε τόξο και προσγειώνεται στο ίδιο σημείο.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"Ανυψώνεται και μένει στον αέρα μέχρι μια Πτώση.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Ανεβαίνει κατά ένα ύψος και μένει εκεί.","Drop to a landing height.":"Κατεβαίνει σε ένα ύψος προσγείωσης.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Παίζει μια κίνηση ή ένα κλιπ μοντέλου.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Παγώνει ένα καρέ μιας κίνησης sprite.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Εμφανίζει ή αποκρύπτει σταδιακά έναν μαχητή.","Flash the battler white.":"Αναβοσβήνει τον μαχητή λευκό.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Εφαρμόζει τη ζημιά και τα εφέ της ικανότητας ή του αντικειμένου.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Δείχνει μια κίνηση της βάσης δεδομένων πάνω σε μαχητή.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Δείχνει, μετακινεί ή κρύβει το κρατούμενο όπλο.","Throw something at the target.":"Ρίχνει κάτι στον στόχο.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Παύει την ακολουθία για έναν αριθμό καρέ.","Play another sequence here.":"Παίζει εδώ μια άλλη ακολουθία.","Play a sound effect file.":"Παίζει ένα αρχείο ηχητικού εφέ.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"Παίζει έναν από τους ήχους συστήματος, όπως Δρομέας ή OK.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Σταματά κάθε ηχητικό εφέ που παίζει.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Μετακινεί, ζουμάρει ή στρέφει την κάμερα μάχης.","Flash the whole screen.":"Αναβοσβήνει όλη την οθόνη.","Tint the screen.":"Χρωματίζει την οθόνη.","Shake the screen.":"Τραντάζει την οθόνη."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["tr"], {"Sound Effect":"Ses efekti","System Sound":"Sistem sesi","Stop Sound Effects":"Ses efektlerini durdur","Battler":"Savaşçı","Camera & Screen":"Kamera ve ekran","Battle UI":"Savaş arayüzü","Targets":"Hedefler","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Hedefe koşar ve hemen önünde durur.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Yakın bir vuruş: yaklaş, savur, geri dön.","Walk back to the home position.":"Başlangıç konumuna yürüyerek döner.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Bir savaşçıyı hedefe, başlangıca veya bir kaydırmaya taşır.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Eve Dön'ün gideceği yeri değiştirir.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Bir savaşçıyı bir yöne veya bir savaşçıya döndürür.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Yay çizerek zıplar ve yerine iner.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"Yükselir ve bir Düşüş'e kadar havada kalır.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Bir yükseklik kadar süzülür ve orada kalır.","Drop to a landing height.":"İniş yüksekliğine düşer.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Bir hareket veya model klibi oynatır.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Bir sprite hareketinin tek karesini dondurur.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Bir savaşçıyı belirir veya solar.","Flash the battler white.":"Savaşçıyı beyaz parlatır.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Yetenek veya eşyanın hasarını ve etkilerini uygular.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Bir savaşçı üzerinde veritabanı animasyonu gösterir.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Tutulan silahı gösterir, taşır veya gizler.","Throw something at the target.":"Hedefe bir şey fırlatır.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Sekansı belirli kare kadar bekletir.","Play another sequence here.":"Burada başka bir sekans oynatır.","Play a sound effect file.":"Bir ses efekti dosyası oynatır.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"İmleç veya Tamam gibi sistem seslerinden birini oynatır.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Çalan tüm ses efektlerini durdurur.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Savaş kamerasını taşır, yaklaştırır veya döndürür.","Flash the whole screen.":"Tüm ekranı parlatır.","Tint the screen.":"Ekranı renklendirir.","Shake the screen.":"Ekranı sallar."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["ar"], {"Sound Effect":"مؤثر صوتي","System Sound":"صوت النظام","Stop Sound Effects":"إيقاف المؤثرات الصوتية","Battler":"المقاتل","Camera & Screen":"الكاميرا والشاشة","Battle UI":"واجهة المعركة","Targets":"الأهداف","Run up to the target and stop short.":"يركض نحو الهدف ويتوقف قبله.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"ضربة قريبة: اقتراب، ضرب، عودة.","Walk back to the home position.":"يعود سيرًا إلى موضع البداية.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"ينقل مقاتلًا إلى الهدف أو موضع البداية أو إزاحة.","Change where Return Home goes.":"يغيّر وجهة «العودة إلى البداية».","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"يوجّه مقاتلًا نحو اتجاه أو مقاتل.","Arc up and land back in place.":"يقفز بقوس ويهبط في مكانه.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"يرتفع ويبقى في الهواء حتى السقوط.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"يطفو لارتفاع ويبقى هناك.","Drop to a landing height.":"يهبط إلى ارتفاع الهبوط.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"يشغّل حركة أو مقطع نموذج.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"يجمّد إطارًا واحدًا من حركة الرسم.","Fade a battler in or out.":"يُظهر مقاتلًا أو يخفيه تدريجيًا.","Flash the battler white.":"يومض المقاتل بالأبيض.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"يطبّق ضرر المهارة أو العنصر وتأثيراتهما.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"يعرض رسمًا متحركًا من قاعدة البيانات على مقاتل.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"يعرض السلاح المحمول أو يحرّكه أو يخفيه.","Throw something at the target.":"يرمي شيئًا نحو الهدف.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"يوقف التسلسل مؤقتًا لعدد من الإطارات.","Play another sequence here.":"يشغّل تسلسلًا آخر هنا.","Play a sound effect file.":"يشغّل ملف مؤثر صوتي.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"يشغّل أحد أصوات النظام مثل المؤشر أو موافق.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"يوقف كل المؤثرات الصوتية الجارية.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"يحرّك كاميرا المعركة أو يقرّبها أو يديرها.","Flash the whole screen.":"يومض الشاشة كاملة.","Tint the screen.":"يلوّن الشاشة.","Shake the screen.":"يهزّ الشاشة."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["id"], {"Sound Effect":"Efek suara","System Sound":"Suara sistem","Stop Sound Effects":"Hentikan efek suara","Battler":"Petarung","Camera & Screen":"Kamera dan layar","Battle UI":"Antarmuka pertempuran","Targets":"Target","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Berlari ke target dan berhenti tepat di depannya.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Serangan jarak dekat: mendekat, mengayun, kembali.","Walk back to the home position.":"Berjalan kembali ke posisi awal.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Memindahkan petarung ke target, posisi awal, atau offset.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Mengubah tujuan Kembali ke Awal.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Memutar petarung menghadap arah atau petarung.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Melompat melengkung dan mendarat di tempat.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"Naik dan tetap di udara sampai Jatuh.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Melayang naik setinggi tertentu dan tetap di sana.","Drop to a landing height.":"Turun ke ketinggian pendaratan.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Memutar gerakan atau klip model.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Membekukan satu bingkai gerakan sprite.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Memunculkan atau memudarkan petarung.","Flash the battler white.":"Mengedipkan petarung menjadi putih.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Menerapkan kerusakan dan efek skill atau item.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Menampilkan animasi basis data pada petarung.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Menampilkan, memindahkan, atau menyembunyikan senjata yang dipegang.","Throw something at the target.":"Melempar sesuatu ke target.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Menjeda urutan selama sejumlah bingkai.","Play another sequence here.":"Memutar urutan lain di sini.","Play a sound effect file.":"Memutar berkas efek suara.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"Memutar salah satu suara sistem, seperti Kursor atau OK.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Menghentikan semua efek suara yang berbunyi.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Memindahkan, memperbesar, atau memutar kamera pertempuran.","Flash the whole screen.":"Mengedipkan seluruh layar.","Tint the screen.":"Mewarnai layar.","Shake the screen.":"Mengguncang layar."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["vi"], {"Sound Effect":"Hiệu ứng âm thanh","System Sound":"Âm thanh hệ thống","Stop Sound Effects":"Dừng hiệu ứng âm thanh","Battler":"Chiến binh","Camera & Screen":"Camera và màn hình","Battle UI":"Giao diện trận đấu","Targets":"Mục tiêu","Run up to the target and stop short.":"Chạy đến mục tiêu và dừng ngay trước.","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"Một đòn cận chiến: tiếp cận, vung, quay về.","Walk back to the home position.":"Đi bộ về vị trí ban đầu.","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"Di chuyển chiến binh đến mục tiêu, vị trí ban đầu hoặc một độ lệch.","Change where Return Home goes.":"Đổi nơi mà Về vị trí dẫn tới.","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"Xoay chiến binh hướng về một hướng hoặc một chiến binh.","Arc up and land back in place.":"Nhảy vòng cung và hạ xuống tại chỗ.","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"Bay lên và ở trên không đến khi Rơi.","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"Trôi lên một độ cao và ở đó.","Drop to a landing height.":"Hạ xuống độ cao tiếp đất.","Play a motion or a model clip.":"Phát một chuyển động hoặc clip mô hình.","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"Đóng băng một khung của chuyển động sprite.","Fade a battler in or out.":"Làm chiến binh hiện dần hoặc mờ dần.","Flash the battler white.":"Nhấp nháy chiến binh màu trắng.","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"Gây sát thương và hiệu ứng của kỹ năng hoặc vật phẩm.","Show a database animation on a battler.":"Hiện một hoạt ảnh trong cơ sở dữ liệu trên chiến binh.","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"Hiện, di chuyển hoặc ẩn vũ khí đang cầm.","Throw something at the target.":"Ném thứ gì đó vào mục tiêu.","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"Tạm dừng chuỗi trong một số khung hình.","Play another sequence here.":"Phát một chuỗi khác tại đây.","Play a sound effect file.":"Phát một tệp hiệu ứng âm thanh.","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"Phát một âm thanh hệ thống, như Con trỏ hoặc OK.","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"Dừng mọi hiệu ứng âm thanh đang phát.","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"Di chuyển, thu phóng hoặc xoay camera trận đấu.","Flash the whole screen.":"Nhấp nháy toàn màn hình.","Tint the screen.":"Nhuộm màu màn hình.","Shake the screen.":"Rung màn hình."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["th"], {"Sound Effect":"เอฟเฟกต์เสียง","System Sound":"เสียงระบบ","Stop Sound Effects":"หยุดเอฟเฟกต์เสียง","Battler":"ผู้ต่อสู้","Camera & Screen":"กล้องและหน้าจอ","Battle UI":"อินเทอร์เฟซการต่อสู้","Targets":"เป้าหมาย","Run up to the target and stop short.":"วิ่งไปหาเป้าหมายและหยุดก่อนถึง","A close-range hit: approach, swing, return.":"โจมตีระยะประชิด: เข้าใกล้ เหวี่ยง กลับ","Walk back to the home position.":"เดินกลับตำแหน่งเริ่มต้น","Move a battler to the target, home or an offset.":"ย้ายผู้ต่อสู้ไปยังเป้าหมาย ตำแหน่งเริ่มต้น หรือระยะเลื่อน","Change where Return Home goes.":"เปลี่ยนจุดหมายของ กลับตำแหน่งเริ่มต้น","Turn a battler to face a direction or a battler.":"หันผู้ต่อสู้ไปทางทิศทางหรือผู้ต่อสู้","Arc up and land back in place.":"กระโดดเป็นเส้นโค้งและลงที่เดิม","Rise and stay aloft until a Fall.":"ลอยขึ้นและอยู่กลางอากาศจนกว่าจะร่วง","Drift up by a height and stay there.":"ลอยขึ้นตามความสูงและอยู่ตรงนั้น","Drop to a landing height.":"ลงมาถึงความสูงที่ลงพื้น","Play a motion or a model clip.":"เล่นท่าทางหรือคลิปโมเดล","Freeze one frame of a sprite motion.":"หยุดภาพหนึ่งเฟรมของท่าทางสไปรต์","Fade a battler in or out.":"ให้ผู้ต่อสู้ค่อยๆ ปรากฏหรือจางหาย","Flash the battler white.":"ให้ผู้ต่อสู้แวบเป็นสีขาว","Deal the skill or item's damage and effects.":"ใช้ความเสียหายและผลของสกิลหรือไอเทม","Show a database animation on a battler.":"แสดงแอนิเมชันจากฐานข้อมูลบนผู้ต่อสู้","Show, move or hide the held weapon.":"แสดง ย้าย หรือซ่อนอาวุธที่ถือ","Throw something at the target.":"ขว้างบางอย่างไปที่เป้าหมาย","Pause the sequence for a number of frames.":"หยุดลำดับชั่วคราวตามจำนวนเฟรม","Play another sequence here.":"เล่นลำดับอื่นตรงนี้","Play a sound effect file.":"เล่นไฟล์เอฟเฟกต์เสียง","Play one of the System sounds, such as Cursor or OK.":"เล่นเสียงระบบ เช่น เคอร์เซอร์ หรือ ตกลง","Stop every sound effect that is playing.":"หยุดเอฟเฟกต์เสียงทั้งหมดที่กำลังเล่น","Move, zoom or turn the battle camera.":"ย้าย ซูม หรือหมุนกล้องการต่อสู้","Flash the whole screen.":"แวบทั้งหน้าจอ","Tint the screen.":"ย้อมสีหน้าจอ","Shake the screen.":"สั่นหน้าจอ"});
