Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.ja, {"Building":"建物","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"このプランの上に置いた他のプランと、その間の舗装された小道。","Parts":"パーツ","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"図面をクリックして置きます。別の形の上なら、その上に載ります。塔は円柱にドームを載せたものです。","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"部屋を描いて建物を始めるか、形を置いてください。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.es, {"Building":"Edificio","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Otros planos colocados sobre este, y senderos pavimentados entre ellos.","Parts":"Partes","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Haz clic en el plano para colocarlo; sobre otra forma, queda encima. Una torre es un cilindro con una cúpula.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Dibuja una habitación para empezar el edificio, o coloca una forma."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS['zh-Hant'], {"Building":"建築","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"放在這份計畫上的其他計畫，以及它們之間鋪好的小徑。","Parts":"零件","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"點擊平面圖來放置；點在另一個形體上，就疊在它上面。塔是圓柱加一個圓頂。","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"畫一個房間來開始建築，或放一個形體。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS['zh-Hans'], {"Building":"建筑","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"放在这份计划上的其他计划，以及它们之间铺好的小径。","Parts":"部件","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"点击平面图来放置；点在另一个形体上，就叠在它上面。塔是圆柱加一个圆顶。","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"画一个房间来开始建筑，或放一个形体。"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.ru, {"Building":"Здание","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Другие планы, размещённые на этом, и мощёные дорожки между ними.","Parts":"Части","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Щёлкните план, чтобы поставить; на другой фигуре — встанет сверху. Башня — это цилиндр с куполом.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Нарисуйте комнату, чтобы начать здание, или поставьте фигуру."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.pt, {"Building":"Edifício","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Outros planos colocados sobre este, e caminhos pavimentados entre eles.","Parts":"Partes","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Clique no plano para o colocar; sobre outra forma, fica em cima. Uma torre é um cilindro com uma cúpula.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Desenhe uma divisão para começar o edifício, ou coloque uma forma."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.de, {"Building":"Gebäude","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Andere Pläne auf diesem, und gepflasterte Wege dazwischen.","Parts":"Teile","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Auf den Plan klicken, um es zu setzen; auf einer anderen Form sitzt es obenauf. Ein Turm ist ein Zylinder mit Kuppel.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Zeichnen Sie einen Raum, um das Gebäude zu beginnen, oder setzen Sie eine Form."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.fr, {"Building":"Bâtiment","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"D'autres plans posés sur celui-ci, et des chemins pavés entre eux.","Parts":"Parties","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Cliquez sur le plan pour le placer ; sur une autre forme, il se pose dessus. Une tour est un cylindre coiffé d'un dôme.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Dessinez une pièce pour commencer le bâtiment, ou placez une forme."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.el, {"Building":"Κτίριο","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Άλλα σχέδια πάνω σε αυτό, και πλακόστρωτα μονοπάτια ανάμεσά τους.","Parts":"Μέρη","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Κάντε κλικ στο σχέδιο για να το τοποθετήσετε· πάνω σε άλλο σχήμα, κάθεται από πάνω. Ένας πύργος είναι κύλινδρος με θόλο.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Σχεδιάστε ένα δωμάτιο για να ξεκινήσει το κτίριο, ή τοποθετήστε ένα σχήμα."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.ko, {"Building":"건물","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"이 플랜 위에 놓은 다른 플랜들과 그 사이의 포장된 길.","Parts":"부품","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"도면을 클릭하면 놓입니다. 다른 도형 위에 클릭하면 그 위에 얹힙니다. 탑은 원기둥에 돔을 얹은 것입니다.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"방을 그려 건물을 시작하거나 도형을 놓으세요."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.ar, {"Building":"المبنى","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"مخططات أخرى موضوعة على هذا، وممرات مرصوفة بينها.","Parts":"الأجزاء","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"انقر المخطط لوضعه؛ وفوق شكل آخر يستقر عليه. البرج أسطوانة تعلوها قبة.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"ارسم غرفة لبدء المبنى، أو ضع شكلاً."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.it, {"Building":"Edificio","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Altri piani posati su questo, e sentieri lastricati tra loro.","Parts":"Parti","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Clicca il piano per metterlo; su un'altra forma, ci si posa sopra. Una torre è un cilindro con una cupola.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Disegna una stanza per iniziare l'edificio, o metti una forma."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.pl, {"Building":"Budynek","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Inne plany umieszczone na tym, i brukowane ścieżki między nimi.","Parts":"Części","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Kliknij plan, aby to umieścić; na innej bryle stanie na niej. Wieża to walec z kopułą.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Narysuj pokój, aby zacząć budynek, albo umieść bryłę."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.id, {"Building":"Bangunan","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Denah lain yang diletakkan di denah ini, dan jalan berbatu di antaranya.","Parts":"Bagian","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Klik denah untuk menaruhnya; di atas bentuk lain, ia duduk di atasnya. Menara adalah silinder dengan kubah.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Gambar sebuah ruangan untuk memulai bangunan, atau taruh sebuah bentuk."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.vi, {"Building":"Tòa nhà","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Các bản vẽ khác đặt lên bản vẽ này, và lối đi lát đá giữa chúng.","Parts":"Các phần","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Nhấp bản vẽ để đặt; nhấp lên hình khác thì nó nằm lên trên. Tháp là hình trụ có mái vòm.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Vẽ một phòng để bắt đầu tòa nhà, hoặc đặt một hình."});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.th, {"Building":"อาคาร","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"แบบแปลนอื่นที่วางบนแบบแปลนนี้ และทางเดินปูหินระหว่างกัน","Parts":"ส่วนประกอบ","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"คลิกแบบแปลนเพื่อวาง หากคลิกบนรูปทรงอื่นจะวางซ้อนด้านบน หอคอยคือทรงกระบอกที่มีโดม","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"วาดห้องเพื่อเริ่มอาคาร หรือวางรูปทรง"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS.tr, {"Building":"Bina","Other plans placed on this one, and paved paths between them.":"Bunun üzerine yerleştirilmiş başka planlar ve aralarındaki taş döşeli yollar.","Parts":"Parçalar","Click the plan to place it; on another shape, it sits on top. A tower is a cylinder with a dome on it.":"Yerleştirmek için plana tıklayın; başka bir şeklin üstüne tıklarsanız onun üstüne oturur. Kule, kubbeli bir silindirdir.","Draw a room to start the building, or place a shape.":"Binaya başlamak için bir oda çizin ya da bir şekil yerleştirin."});

