Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["th"], {"Party Followers":"ผู้ติดตามในปาร์ตี้","Change Follower Formation":"เปลี่ยนรูปขบวนผู้ติดตาม","Follower Orders":"คำสั่งผู้ติดตาม","Single file":"แถวเดี่ยว","Loose":"แถวหลวม","Side by side":"เคียงข้างกัน","Wedge":"รูปลิ่ม","Column of two":"แถวตอนเรียงสอง","Scattered":"กระจายตัว","Followers walk in single file, {n} apart":"ผู้ติดตามเดินแถวเดี่ยว ห่างกัน {n}","Followers walk in a loose file, {n} apart":"ผู้ติดตามเดินแถวหลวม ห่างกัน {n}","Followers walk side by side, {n} apart":"ผู้ติดตามเดินเคียงข้างกัน ห่างกัน {n}","Followers walk in a wedge, {n} apart":"ผู้ติดตามเดินเป็นรูปลิ่ม ห่างกัน {n}","Followers walk in a column of two, {n} apart":"ผู้ติดตามเดินแถวตอนเรียงสอง ห่างกัน {n}","Followers walk scattered, {n} apart":"ผู้ติดตามเดินกระจายตัว ห่างกัน {n}","Followers walk in the game's own formation":"ผู้ติดตามเดินตามรูปขบวนเริ่มต้นของเกม",", straggle {p}%":" ล้าหลัง {p}%","1 tile":"1 ช่อง","{n} tiles":"{n} ช่อง","Stay here":"อยู่ตรงนี้","Go to a tile":"ไปยังช่อง","Come to the leader":"มาหาผู้นำ","{who} follows the leader":"{who} ตามผู้นำ","All followers follow the leader":"ผู้ติดตามทั้งหมดตามผู้นำ","{who} stays here":"{who} อยู่ตรงนี้","All followers stay here":"ผู้ติดตามทั้งหมดอยู่ตรงนี้","{who} goes to ({x}, {y})":"{who} ไปยัง ({x}, {y})","All followers go to ({x}, {y})":"ผู้ติดตามทั้งหมดไปยัง ({x}, {y})","{who} comes to the leader":"{who} มาหาผู้นำ","All followers come to the leader":"ผู้ติดตามทั้งหมดมาหาผู้นำ","{who} is hidden":"{who} ถูกซ่อน","All followers are hidden":"ผู้ติดตามทั้งหมดถูกซ่อน","{who} is shown":"{who} ถูกแสดง","All followers are shown":"ผู้ติดตามทั้งหมดถูกแสดง","As it arrives":"ตามทิศที่มาถึง",", facing down":" หันลง",", facing left":" หันซ้าย",", facing right":" หันขวา",", facing up":" หันขึ้น"," and waits":" และรอ"," and wait":" และรอ","Follower {n}":"ผู้ติดตาม {n}","Follower {n} (beyond the party's size)":"ผู้ติดตาม {n} (เกินขนาดปาร์ตี้)","Actor {id}":"ตัวละคร {id}","The game's default":"ค่าเริ่มต้นของเกม","Straggle":"การล้าหลัง","Straggle: how late and how unevenly they follow.":"การล้าหลัง: ตามช้าและไม่พร้อมเพรียงแค่ไหน","From now on; kept with the save.":"มีผลนับจากนี้ และบันทึกไปกับเซฟ","All followers":"ผู้ติดตามทั้งหมด","By actor":"ตามตัวละคร","Pick on the Map...":"เลือกบนแผนที่...","Wait for the arrival":"รอจนมาถึง","Back into the line.":"กลับเข้าแถว","Holds its tile and its facing until told to follow.":"อยู่ที่ช่องเดิมและหันทิศเดิมจนกว่าจะสั่งให้ตาม","Walks there by the shortest open way, then stays.":"เดินไปที่นั่นตามทางเปิดที่สั้นที่สุด แล้วอยู่ที่นั่น","Walks back to the leader, then follows.":"เดินกลับมาหาผู้นำ แล้วตามต่อ","Not seen; the party is unchanged.":"มองไม่เห็น ปาร์ตี้ไม่เปลี่ยน","Seen again.":"มองเห็นอีกครั้ง","Move to Tile":"ย้ายไปยังช่อง","Move to Tile...":"ย้ายไปยังช่อง...","Move to":"ย้ายไปยัง","Walks there by the shortest open way. The route waits until it arrives.":"เดินไปที่นั่นตามทางเปิดที่สั้นที่สุด เส้นทางจะรอจนกว่าจะไปถึง","A follower leaves the line for the route and stays where it ends until told to follow.":"ผู้ติดตามออกจากแถวระหว่างเดินตามเส้นทาง และอยู่ที่จุดสิ้นสุดจนกว่าจะสั่งให้ตาม","Follower Formation":"รูปขบวนผู้ติดตาม","What to do":"สิ่งที่ให้ทำ","Spacing":"ระยะห่าง"});
Object.assign(RR_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS["tr"], {"Party Followers":"Grup Takipçileri","Change Follower Formation":"Takipçi Düzenini Değiştir","Follower Orders":"Takipçi Emirleri","Single file":"Tek sıra","Loose":"Gevşek sıra","Side by side":"Yan yana","Wedge":"Kama","Column of two":"İkişerli kol","Scattered":"Dağınık","Followers walk in single file, {n} apart":"Takipçiler tek sıra yürür, {n} arayla","Followers walk in a loose file, {n} apart":"Takipçiler gevşek sırada yürür, {n} arayla","Followers walk side by side, {n} apart":"Takipçiler yan yana yürür, {n} arayla","Followers walk in a wedge, {n} apart":"Takipçiler kama düzeninde yürür, {n} arayla","Followers walk in a column of two, {n} apart":"Takipçiler ikişerli kolda yürür, {n} arayla","Followers walk scattered, {n} apart":"Takipçiler dağınık yürür, {n} arayla","Followers walk in the game's own formation":"Takipçiler oyunun kendi düzeninde yürür",", straggle {p}%":", geride kalma %{p}","1 tile":"1 karo","{n} tiles":"{n} karo","Stay here":"Burada kal","Go to a tile":"Bir karoya git","Come to the leader":"Lidere gel","{who} follows the leader":"{who} lideri takip eder","All followers follow the leader":"Tüm takipçiler lideri takip eder","{who} stays here":"{who} burada kalır","All followers stay here":"Tüm takipçiler burada kalır","{who} goes to ({x}, {y})":"{who} ({x}, {y}) konumuna gider","All followers go to ({x}, {y})":"Tüm takipçiler ({x}, {y}) konumuna gider","{who} comes to the leader":"{who} lidere gelir","All followers come to the leader":"Tüm takipçiler lidere gelir","{who} is hidden":"{who} gizlenir","All followers are hidden":"Tüm takipçiler gizlenir","{who} is shown":"{who} gösterilir","All followers are shown":"Tüm takipçiler gösterilir","As it arrives":"Vardığı gibi",", facing down":", aşağı bakar",", facing left":", sola bakar",", facing right":", sağa bakar",", facing up":", yukarı bakar"," and waits":" ve bekler"," and wait":" ve bekler","Follower {n}":"Takipçi {n}","Follower {n} (beyond the party's size)":"Takipçi {n} (grup boyutunun dışında)","Actor {id}":"Aktör {id}","The game's default":"Oyunun varsayılanı","Straggle":"Geride kalma","Straggle: how late and how unevenly they follow.":"Geride kalma: ne kadar geç ve ne kadar düzensiz takip ettikleri.","From now on; kept with the save.":"Şu andan itibaren; kayıtla birlikte saklanır.","All followers":"Tüm takipçiler","By actor":"Aktöre göre","Pick on the Map...":"Haritadan seç...","Wait for the arrival":"Varmasını bekle","Back into the line.":"Sıraya geri döner.","Holds its tile and its facing until told to follow.":"Takip etmesi söylenene kadar karosunu ve yönünü korur.","Walks there by the shortest open way, then stays.":"Oraya en kısa açık yoldan yürür, sonra kalır.","Walks back to the leader, then follows.":"Lidere yürüyerek döner, sonra takip eder.","Not seen; the party is unchanged.":"Görünmez; grup değişmez.","Seen again.":"Yeniden görünür.","Move to Tile":"Karoya Git","Move to Tile...":"Karoya Git...","Move to":"Git:","Walks there by the shortest open way. The route waits until it arrives.":"Oraya en kısa açık yoldan yürür. Rota, varana kadar bekler.","A follower leaves the line for the route and stays where it ends until told to follow.":"Takipçi rota boyunca sıradan ayrılır ve takip etmesi söylenene kadar rotanın bittiği yerde kalır.","Follower Formation":"Takipçi Düzeni","What to do":"Ne yapsın","Spacing":"Aralık"});
