// Database › 3D Models: the Optimize dialog's texture compression and its no-reduction choice.
const RR_MODEL_OPTIMIZE_TEXT = {"ja": {"Do not reduce": "縮小しない", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "メッシュとテクスチャのサイズをそのまま保ちます。", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "各テクスチャに圧縮版を追加し、グラフィックメモリ使用量を4分の1にします。テクスチャ1枚につき数秒かかります。"}, "es": {"Do not reduce": "No reducir", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Mantener la malla y el tamaño de las texturas tal como están.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Añade una copia comprimida de cada textura que ocupa una cuarta parte de la memoria gráfica. Tarda unos segundos por textura."}, "zh-Hant": {"Do not reduce": "不縮減", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "保留網格與紋理尺寸不變。", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "為每個紋理加入壓縮副本，只佔四分之一的顯示記憶體。每個紋理需數秒。"}, "zh-Hans": {"Do not reduce": "不缩减", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "保留网格和纹理尺寸不变。", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "为每个纹理添加压缩副本，只占四分之一的显存。每个纹理需数秒。"}, "ru": {"Do not reduce": "Не уменьшать", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Оставить сетку и размеры текстур как есть.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Добавляет сжатую копию каждой текстуры, занимающую четверть видеопамяти. Занимает несколько секунд на текстуру."}, "pt": {"Do not reduce": "Não reduzir", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Manter a malha e o tamanho das texturas como estão.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Adiciona uma cópia comprimida de cada textura que ocupa um quarto da memória gráfica. Leva alguns segundos por textura."}, "de": {"Do not reduce": "Nicht verkleinern", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Mesh und Texturgrößen bleiben unverändert.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Fügt jeder Textur eine komprimierte Kopie hinzu, die ein Viertel des Grafikspeichers belegt. Dauert einige Sekunden pro Textur."}, "fr": {"Do not reduce": "Ne pas réduire", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Garder le maillage et la taille des textures tels quels.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Ajoute une copie compressée de chaque texture qui occupe un quart de la mémoire graphique. Prend quelques secondes par texture."}, "el": {"Do not reduce": "Χωρίς μείωση", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Το πλέγμα και τα μεγέθη των υφών μένουν ως έχουν.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Προσθέτει ένα συμπιεσμένο αντίγραφο κάθε υφής που καταλαμβάνει το ένα τέταρτο της μνήμης γραφικών. Χρειάζεται λίγα δευτερόλεπτα ανά υφή."}, "ko": {"Do not reduce": "줄이지 않기", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "메시와 텍스처 크기를 그대로 유지합니다.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "각 텍스처에 압축 사본을 추가해 그래픽 메모리를 4분의 1만 사용합니다. 텍스처당 몇 초가 걸립니다."}, "ar": {"Do not reduce": "بدون تقليص", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "إبقاء الشبكة وأحجام الأنسجة كما هي.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "يضيف نسخة مضغوطة من كل نسيج تشغل ربع ذاكرة الرسوميات. يستغرق بضع ثوانٍ لكل نسيج."}, "it": {"Do not reduce": "Non ridurre", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Mantieni la mesh e le dimensioni delle texture come sono.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Aggiunge una copia compressa di ogni texture che occupa un quarto della memoria grafica. Richiede alcuni secondi per texture."}, "pl": {"Do not reduce": "Nie zmniejszaj", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Siatka i rozmiary tekstur pozostają bez zmian.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Dodaje skompresowaną kopię każdej tekstury, zajmującą jedną czwartą pamięci graficznej. Trwa kilka sekund na teksturę."}, "id": {"Do not reduce": "Jangan kurangi", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Pertahankan mesh dan ukuran tekstur apa adanya.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Menambahkan salinan terkompresi untuk setiap tekstur yang hanya memakai seperempat memori grafis. Butuh beberapa detik per tekstur."}, "vi": {"Do not reduce": "Không giảm", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Giữ nguyên lưới và kích thước kết cấu.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Thêm một bản nén của mỗi kết cấu, chỉ chiếm một phần tư bộ nhớ đồ họa. Mất vài giây cho mỗi kết cấu."}, "th": {"Do not reduce": "ไม่ลดขนาด", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "คงเมชและขนาดเท็กซ์เจอร์ไว้ตามเดิม", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "เพิ่มสำเนาบีบอัดของแต่ละเท็กซ์เจอร์ซึ่งใช้หน่วยความจำกราฟิกเพียงหนึ่งในสี่ ใช้เวลาไม่กี่วินาทีต่อเท็กซ์เจอร์"}, "tr": {"Do not reduce": "Küçültme", "Keep the mesh and texture sizes as they are.": "Ağı ve doku boyutlarını olduğu gibi bırakır.", "Adds a compressed copy of each texture that takes a quarter of the graphics memory. Takes a few seconds per texture.": "Her dokuya, grafik belleğinin dörtte birini kaplayan sıkıştırılmış bir kopya ekler. Doku başına birkaç saniye sürer."}};
